ATM failures and blocked-card issues can shift customers toward branches, esp=
ecially during infrastructure disruption. The possible stories are that custo=
mers switch to smaller withdrawals or branch contact, that specific provinces=
 show repeat access failure, or that cash-bin or host issues dominate.

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use August 2023 as the new evidence point rather=
 than recycling the earlier conclusion. The discussion is currently being dri=
ven by anecdotes, and the teams involved are describing the same customers di=
fferently.

