 was included. The output must help us decide where contingency communication=
 and ATM support should be prioritised.

Data available: ATM attempts, host responses, PIN attempts, blocked-card stat=
e and latency; transaction-level timestamps, channels, amounts, statuses and =
error context; customer contacts, complaints and suggestions; monthly custome=
r and KYC snapshots.

